    "happily": {
      "word": "HAPPILY",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "By chance; peradventure; haply. [Obs.] Piers Plowman.",
          "partOfSpeech": "adverb"
        },
        {
          "text": "By good fortune; fortunately; luckily. Preferred by conquest, happily o'erthrown. Waller.",
          "partOfSpeech": "adverb"
        },
        {
          "text": "In a happy manner or state; in happy circumstances; as, he lived happily with his wife.",
          "partOfSpeech": "adverb"
        },
        {
          "text": "With address or dexterity; gracefully; felicitously; in a manner to success; with success. Formed by thy converse, happily to steer From grave to gay, from lively to severe. Pope. dexterously; felicitously.",
